  * Orphan sweeps never abort a project load (869evtdf7, backport of
    stagesoft/cuems-engine#29). An orphaned player the node could not kill
    (EPERM: a process of another user whose command line merely contained
    "cuems-audioplayer") escaped _load_project_inner after the old project
    was torn down: no armed_ready, only "Error executing command callback
    for load: [Errno 1] Operation not permitted". Both sweeps and the zombie
    JACK client cleanup now log and go on (EPERM names the PID and owner;
    pgrep rc >= 2 is a WARNING), match only own-user processes with argv[0]
    anchored, warn at start about unknown player binary names, and the
    command callback failure is logged with its traceback.

